{
  "sourceId": "post-handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform-zh-CN",
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "source": {
    "kind": "single-post",
    "postId": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵在 Terraform 中使用 count = 0 来实现功能切换是很常见的。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，当它在资源中实现且功能被停用时，可能会导致空元组错误。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "元组是一种可以包含任意数量不同类型元素的列表类型。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "索引零用于访问已启用的资源，例如 module.feature[0].id 。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "当资源被停用时，元组为空，且 module.feature[0] 不存在，导致错误。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "例如，以下代码运行良好：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "输出：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，当 my_tuple 为空时会抛出错误。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "输出：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "功能切换是空元组的常见使用案例。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，空元组还有其他使用案例。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "例如，如果您使用的模块返回元组，您可能想处理元组为空的情况。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以下是可用于在 Terraform 中处理空元组的技术，",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "处理空元组的直接方法是在尝试访问元素之前使用条件表达式检查元组是否为空。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以下是如何使用条件表达式的示例：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在此示例中， length() 函数用于检查 my_tuple 是否为空。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果 my_tuple 不为空，则第一个元素 ([0]) 中的 name 被分配给 result 变量。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果 my_tuple 为空，则\"default-value\"被分配给 result 变量。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不会抛出空元组错误，因为当 my_tuple 为空时不会评估 local.my_tuple[0].name 。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "当变量名称很长时，这可能难以阅读，因为变量名称在条件表达式中重复了两次。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "处理空元组的另一种方法是使用 try() 函数。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "try() 函数用于尝试访问值，如果值未定义则提供默认值。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以下是如何使用 try() 函数的示例：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在此示例中， try() 函数用于尝试访问 my_tuple 第一个元素 ([0]) 中的 name。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "由于 my_tuple 为空，字符串\"default-value\"被用作 value 的默认值。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在 Terraform 0.13.0 中，您可以使用 for 表达式来处理空元组：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这是可读性最低的方法，但带我们进入下面的展开表达式：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "for 表达式和展开表达式在 Terraform 0.12.29 中不受支持，但在 Terraform 0.13.0 及更高版本中受支持。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "此外，如果 my_tuple 为空，两者都会返回空元组，与可以指定默认值的条件表达式和 try() 函数不同。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "旧版展开表达式 local.my_tuple.*.name 在 Terraform 0.12.29 及更高版本（截至本文发布日期为 v1.4）中也受支持。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，不建议使用此方法，因为它可能在未来版本中被移除。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "有关展开表达式的更多信息，↵https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/expressions/splat",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "值得注意的是，表达式的结果是元组。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您可能需要使用 tolist() 函数将其转换为列表，或者如果您想删除重复项和/或排序项目，则使用 toset() 函数。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "compact() 函数可用于从列表中删除空字符串和 null 值。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您还可以使用 join() 函数将列表转换为字符串。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用带有动态块的 for_each meta-argument 可以是功能切换的一种方法，但超出了本文的范围。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "https://support.hashicorp.com/hc/en-us/articles/9471971461651-ERROR-Invalid-index-on-empty-tuple↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中处理列表中空元组的无效索引",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    }
